Hi! Thanks Resham and Gabrielė 🙏

No, this feature is only about adding some visibility to drivers about what positive comments they receive. This doesn’t change our approach on blockings or any benefits 

{quote}If the drivers receive significant number of negative comments. will this be detrimental to the drivers i.e. will they be blocked or face any other consequences? On a contrary will there be any benefits for the driver in case they receive all positive comments i.e. will they receive any bonus or compensation for all positive comments?{quote}

