**** _Dynamic Pricing: identified by the HOPP Platform, taking into account the estimated journey time and distance, and any temporal, dynamic pricing variations; or_
**** _Minimum Expected Journey Fee (where this feature is available): calculated based on relevant available rate elements, such as a per mile rate, which are variable by you._

